{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-jsx","path":"/start-kotlin/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"yongniverse"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"f72a09e2-53ff-5562-baab-6bd89d0a82c7","excerpt":"앱 개발 언어 및 프레임워크 선택 앱을 만들고 싶다는 생각이 들었습니다. 어떤 언어와 프레임워크를 사용할지 고민이 많았는데요. Kotlin? Swift? Flutter? React Native? 아직 구상 단계이고, 안드로이드에 집중해서 공부하고 싶어 Kotlin을 선택했습니다. 언어 선택에 있어 저세상개발자님의 유튜브 영상이 큰 도움이 되었습니다. 앱을…","html":"<h2 id=\"앱-개발-언어-및-프레임워크-선택\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%95%B1-%EA%B0%9C%EB%B0%9C-%EC%96%B8%EC%96%B4-%EB%B0%8F-%ED%94%84%EB%A0%88%EC%9E%84%EC%9B%8C%ED%81%AC-%EC%84%A0%ED%83%9D\" aria-label=\"앱 개발 언어 및 프레임워크 선택 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>앱 개발 언어 및 프레임워크 선택</h2>\n<p>앱을 만들고 싶다는 생각이 들었습니다.</p>\n<p>어떤 언어와 프레임워크를 사용할지 고민이 많았는데요.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Kotlin? Swift? Flutter? React Native?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>아직 구상 단계이고, 안드로이드에 집중해서 공부하고 싶어 <strong>Kotlin</strong>을 선택했습니다.</p>\n<p>언어 선택에 있어 저세상개발자님의 유튜브 영상이 큰 도움이 되었습니다.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IGuDm7AMnw4&#x26;ab_channel=%EC%A0%80%EC%84%B8%EC%83%81%EA%B0%9C%EB%B0%9C%EC%9E%90\"><img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/IGuDm7AMnw4/0.jpg\" alt=\"앱을 만드는 방법 유튜브 썸네일\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"Kotlin-개발-환경-설정\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Kotlin-%EA%B0%9C%EB%B0%9C-%ED%99%98%EA%B2%BD-%EC%84%A4%EC%A0%95\" aria-label=\"Kotlin 개발 환경 설정 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>Kotlin 개발 환경 설정</h2>\n<p><strong>내 개발환경:</strong> <code class=\"language-text\">MacBook Pro 14 M4 😎</code></p>\n<h3 id=\"1-JDK-설치\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#1-JDK-%EC%84%A4%EC%B9%98\" aria-label=\"1 JDK 설치 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>1. JDK 설치</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\">brew <span class=\"token function\">install</span> openjdk</code></pre></div>\n<p>설치 후 환경 변수에 JDK 경로를 추가합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token builtin class-name\">echo</span> <span class=\"token string\">'export PATH=\"/opt/homebrew/opt/openjdk/bin:$PATH\"'</span> <span class=\"token operator\">>></span> ~/.zshrc\n<span class=\"token builtin class-name\">source</span> ~/.zshrc</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"2-Android-Studio-설치\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#2-Android-Studio-%EC%84%A4%EC%B9%98\" aria-label=\"2 Android Studio 설치 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>2. Android Studio 설치</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\">brew <span class=\"token function\">install</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--cask</span> android-studio</code></pre></div>\n<p>설치가 완료되면 Android Studio를 실행합니다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"3-Android-Studio로-프로젝트-생성\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#3-Android-Studio%EB%A1%9C-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%A0%9D%ED%8A%B8-%EC%83%9D%EC%84%B1\" aria-label=\"3 Android Studio로 프로젝트 생성 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>3. Android Studio로 프로젝트 생성</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Android Studio 실행</li>\n<li>\"New Project\" 클릭</li>\n<li>\"Phone and Tablet\" > \"Empty Activity\" 선택</li>\n<li>언어를 <strong>Kotlin</strong>으로 설정</li>\n<li>프로젝트 이름과 저장 경로 입력 후 \"Finish\" 클릭</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class='gatsby-resp-image-figure' style='margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; '>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/5f01cee408d5323d6284a76c69449a00/72f8f/isthisend.jpg' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 80%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='예. hello world 찍어보시면 됩니다.' title='' src='/static/5f01cee408d5323d6284a76c69449a00/a22ce/isthisend.jpg' srcset='/static/5f01cee408d5323d6284a76c69449a00/0b705/isthisend.jpg 170w,\n/static/5f01cee408d5323d6284a76c69449a00/31389/isthisend.jpg 340w,\n/static/5f01cee408d5323d6284a76c69449a00/a22ce/isthisend.jpg 680w,\n/static/5f01cee408d5323d6284a76c69449a00/72f8f/isthisend.jpg 736w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption class='gatsby-resp-image-figcaption'>예. hello world 찍어보시면 됩니다.</figcaption>\n  </figure>\n<h3 id=\"4-Kotlin-Hello-World-예제\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#4-Kotlin-Hello-World-%EC%98%88%EC%A0%9C\" aria-label=\"4 Kotlin Hello World 예제 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>4. Kotlin Hello World 예제</h3>\n<p>아래는 Kotlin으로 작성한 간단한 Hello World 코드입니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"kotlin\"><pre class=\"language-kotlin\"><code class=\"language-kotlin\"><span class=\"token keyword\">fun</span> <span class=\"token function\">main</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token function\">println</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"Hello, World!\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Android Studio에서 <code class=\"language-text\">MainActivity.kt</code> 파일의 <code class=\"language-text\">onCreate</code> 함수에 아래 코드를 추가하면 앱 화면에 \"Hello, World!\"가 출력됩니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"kotlin\"><pre class=\"language-kotlin\"><code class=\"language-kotlin\"><span class=\"token keyword\">override</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">fun</span> <span class=\"token function\">onCreate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>savedInstanceState<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> Bundle<span class=\"token operator\">?</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">super</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">onCreate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>savedInstanceState<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token function\">setContentView</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>R<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>layout<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>activity_main<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token function\">println</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-literal singleline\"><span class=\"token string\">\"Hello, World!\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"Kotlin-기본-문법\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Kotlin-%EA%B8%B0%EB%B3%B8-%EB%AC%B8%EB%B2%95\" aria-label=\"Kotlin 기본 문법 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>Kotlin 기본 문법</h2>\n<h3 id=\"변수-선언\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%B3%80%EC%88%98-%EC%84%A0%EC%96%B8\" aria-label=\"변수 선언 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6